## capability-contract
permission surface=ApprovalOverlay
event | command | surface | guarantee
AssistantDelta | SubmitPrompt | Transcript | streamed text is visible and replayable
ToolProgress | Abort | ToolActivity | running tools expose compact and detailed status
PermissionRequest | ApprovalResponse | ApprovalOverlay | missing response defaults to deny
SubsystemStatus | OpenPanel | FeaturePanel | subsystem health has a visible entry point
AgentUpdate | SelectItem | SelectionSurface | agent choices remain keyboard reachable

## event-router
Terminal(Key("Enter")) -> [QueueInput, Redraw]
Engine(PermissionRequested("bash")) -> [ShowApproval, Redraw]
OverlayResponse("allow") -> [CloseOverlay, Redraw]

